  "description": "Crew Bike Co. CB Core 29\" – Ride Hard. Keep It Core.\nThe CB Core 29\" can do it all. Whether you’re throwing it up for a wheelie, cruising the city, or linking up with the squad, the CB Core 29\" delivers the size, control, and flow you need to keep your ride clean. With a lightweight aluminum frame and durable components, it’s built to handle miles of rideouts, tricks, and everyday street sessions.\nKey Features\n29” Double-Wall Rims – Tough enough for wheelies, smooth enough for the streets.\nSealed Bearing Headset & Bottom Bracket – Stay smooth through every combo and coast.\n3-Piece Cranks – Strength and power for endless pedal work and pop-ups.\nBig Wheel Geometry – BMX roots with cruiser comfort for long rides and stable landings.\nThe CB Core 29\" keeps the heart of the CB29—big wheels, street style, and ride-anywhere energy—but makes it accessible for every rider ready to join the movement. Whether you’re chasing balance point or leading the pack, the CB Core 29\" is built to keep it core and keep it rolling.",
